{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-10/1061496/block/singleImage/3255069/df/10-04_3.jpg?updatedAt=1793589046\"/><figcaption>蓮塘香園圍口岸開通6年，出入境人次突破1億</figcaption></figure><p>蓮塘/香園圍口岸2020年8月通關。深圳出入境邊防檢查總站統計，截至11月1日，出入境人次超過1億、車輛超過600萬架次。 每3人有1人刷臉通關 蓮塘口岸在6年來，客流及車流持續上升，日均出入境人次查驗量9.4萬，接年增加37%。今年首10個月，蓮塘口岸港澳居民出入境人次超過2,130萬，較去年同期多12.7%。目前平均每3名出入境人次中，有1人刷臉通關，口岸整體通關效率提升37.2%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:40:46.665779+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:10:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:38:16.498808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:07.777753+00:00","content_hash":"5da9be3d46f2273b3b8bc1e7b308b48c3d91e2fa8b81f642ece2afde0103a159","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:40:46.665779+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}